00:04:07.195 --> 00:04:09.355
<v Vocab>分離

00:04:09.756 --> 00:04:13.187
<v Host>It means separation — coming apart from something.

00:04:13.788 --> 00:04:30.803
<v Slow>準天頂衛星は、日本のほぼ真上を長く飛ぶ特別な軌道を回るため、高いビルや山が多い場所でも電波が届きやすいという特長があります。

00:04:31.603 --> 00:04:40.723
<v Host>These satellites follow a special orbit almost directly over Japan, so the signal reaches even places full of tall buildings and mountains.

00:04:41.324 --> 00:04:43.555
