00:05:34.124 --> 00:05:42.980
<v Host>The positioning data is used in smartphone maps and car navigation, and also in self-driving farm tractors and drone deliveries.

00:05:43.579 --> 00:05:46.435
<v Vocab>自動運転

00:05:46.836 --> 00:05:51.012
<v Host>It means self-driving — a machine that steers itself.

00:05:51.612 --> 00:06:03.444
<v Slow>誤差わずか数センチという、正確な位置情報を届けるサービスもあり、利用はさらに広がる見込みです。

00:06:04.244 --> 00:06:11.732
<v Host>One service delivers positions accurate to within just a few centimeters, and its use is expected to keep spreading.

00:06:12.331 --> 00:06:14.372
